  "description": "Convenience meta-package that references the entire Scrubkit family: core engine, PDF extractor, Image EXIF extractor, email (.eml/.msg), OpenDocument, .epub, legacy binary Office (.doc/.xls/.ppt), Parquet, DI integration, Microsoft.Extensions.AI, and Semantic Kernel. Ships .AddAllExtractors() auto-registration.",
